      "username": "omnitron-plus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/omnitron-plus/{size}/5966_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-08-22T04:40:54.472Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Legacy, Wraith and Ra are all good and fairly straightforward heroes. I think stick with lower complexity heroes, but maybe a few harder but fun ones like Tempest. Blade is my favorite villain for introduction, for obvious reasons. Maybe let others decide which environment they want, as long as it isn’t to complex. Great idea though!</p>",
