      "created_at": "2023-08-22T13:12:07.975Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Legacy might be the closest to getting boring since his turns are the least complex out of anyone.   Ra’s shtick is burning things but he can get complex in keeping out setups.   Regardless, if they get bored with any given hero after the first game then they can dig into other heroes in the box.</p>",
