      "id": 253761,
      "name": "Kento",
      "username": "psychedelicchurro",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/psychedelicchurro/{size}/6027_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-08-22T21:52:56.355Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For what it’s worth, I’ve been playing for years, I’m still happy to play Ra anytime.</p>\n<p>I don’t find that complexity necessarily means more fun, and Ra has interesting interactions in his deck. The reason he’s less complex is that his interactions can mostly be ignored in favorite of just burning everything that moves.</p>\n<p>Again, your mileage may vary.</p>",
