      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-08-23T01:59:22.333Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t think Unity or CC are great, since you have to introduce the idea of non-Character hero targets. Not AA or AZ for obvious reasons, and probably not Bunker either because of his weird tempo. Not Fanatic, because she’s unlikely to pop off. Legacy is a good choice for you to play yourself, since he’s boring and you can turn your brain off. (Christopher does this when he demos.) I think the rest are all fine.</p>",
